OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a wet
OL,6,Fand cloudy day, skies will clear for
OL,7,Fmost overnight, although, showers will
OL,8,Flinger in the east of the region until
OL,9,Fthe morning. Temperatures will fall,
OL,10,Fmaking it feel cooler than recently.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FLargely bright and sunny
OL,13,Fafter a cool start, with showers
OL,14,Fcontinuing to affect eastern regions.
OL,15,FBecoming overcast from late afternoon,
OL,16,Fahead of rain and stronger winds
OL,17,Fspreading east overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
