OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain Friday,
OL,7,Fclearing later in the afternoon.
OL,8,FBreezy with sunny spells and showers
OL,9,Fon Saturday. Becoming drier and more
OL,10,Fsettled on Sunday.
